msgid ""
"**Figure 3.** Free energy surface (LJ units) in the space of the collective "
"variables second and third central moment. Orange stars represent the "
"location of the local minima isomers of the LJ cluster in this space."
msgstr ""

#: MTD.md:111
msgid ""
"Note that bias is added over all states, meaning that the system jumped from"
" one state to another and gave a complete reconstruction of the free energy "
"surface."
msgstr ""

